        <mxCell id="xFenNF8ksm78lh0Gskk3-7" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontFamily=Quicksand Medium;fontColor=#424242;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 190%;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(66, 66, 66), rgb(180, 180, 180));&quot;&gt;Does the institution have the required infrastructure in-house?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;What is the available cost budget?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Does the project have adequate time to achieve its goals?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Are external stakeholders accessible?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;How volatile are the external requirements?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;How accepting of changes&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(66, 66, 66), rgb(180, 180, 180));&quot;&gt;are external stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(66, 66, 66), rgb(180, 180, 180));&quot;&gt;?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;How many are the formal interface/safety requirements?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
